WEBVTT

00:04:29.566 --> 00:04:31.034
so I'm like, "This is a sign!

00:04:31.067 --> 00:04:35.272
I'm just not supposed to be interacting
like that right now."

00:04:35.305 --> 00:04:37.507
So just listening and knowing

00:04:37.541 --> 00:04:39.743
that you don't have to fall
under the pressure.

00:04:39.743 --> 00:04:43.113
Like, I think so often
we think that if we don't post,

00:04:43.113 --> 00:04:44.414
we don't exist.

00:04:44.447 --> 00:04:47.717
Our existence, you know --

00:04:47.717 --> 00:04:50.287
we only exist when other people
see us existing.

00:04:50.287 --> 00:04:52.055
Like, that, that whole line, like,

00:04:52.088 --> 00:04:55.225
"Oh, if you didn't post about it,
it didn't happen."

00:04:55.225 --> 00:04:56.960
That concept.

00:04:57.294 --> 00:04:59.162
We've started to internalize, you know,

00:04:59.162 --> 00:05:03.099
especially my generation
of millennials, gen-Z,